8598  E495              ; Blocking keyboard input for code running in MMU7.  The resident INKEY
8599  E495              ; cannot be used here: its retry path calls gettime, and gettime changes the
8600  E495              ; $C000-$FFFF mapping through $7FFD.  Require a full release both before and
8601  E495              ; after the key so the H used to open Help is not consumed by the dialog.
